{
  "capability_contracts": [
    {
      "description": "Optional bounded C semantic presentation extension alongside unchanged ABI 1",
      "documentation": [
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/blob/eb246d3fd81353fc3be27c8924ee2321067530bf/docs/engineering/c-presentation.md"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/blob/eb246d3fd81353fc3be27c8924ee2321067530bf/docs/engineering/c-presentation.md"
      ],
      "guarantees": [
        "Explicit extension size/version/reserved-zero records; borrowed input, caller-owned output",
        "Existing ABI 1 layouts and meanings unchanged; no private Rust layouts or allocator ownership escape"
      ],
      "id": "abi.c.presentation_v1",
      "maturity": "experimental",
      "platforms": [
        "linux"
      ],
      "surfaces": [
        "c-presentation-v1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "Immutable revision-identified draft snapshots and atomic stale-result refusal",
      "documentation": [
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/blob/aa137e881065f0a0615fa8ae03c84c89f052bea3/docs/interaction.md#revision-aware-host-analysis",
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/blob/eb246d3fd81353fc3be27c8924ee2321067530bf/docs/engineering/c-presentation.md"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/actions/runs/34475749705",
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/blob/aa137e881065f0a0615fa8ae03c84c89f052bea3/docs/engineering/analysis-protocol.md",
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/actions/runs/34703095088",
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/actions/runs/34703089136",
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/blob/7f8f696f98b33d8e4ea6f08e243fe0d5e5351724/docs/engineering/release-packaging.md",
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/blob/eb246d3fd81353fc3be27c8924ee2321067530bf/docs/engineering/c-presentation.md"
      ],
      "guarantees": [
        "One opaque identity scoped to the originating retained Editor; successful text/cursor changes advance, no-ops and rejected edits do not",
        "Submit, editing interrupt and EOF end the semantic draft; unchanged close/reopen, resize and coordinated output preserve draft provenance",
        "Snapshots own immutable shared text, cursor and revision; hosts own all parsing, context, scheduling and derived payloads",
        "Revision-bound replacement refuses stale results before validation or mutation, without history or terminal output effects",
        "Checked 128-bit exhaustion panics before mutation rather than wrapping; unrelated editors are separate identity domains",
        "Rust Editor is portable; native Interaction completion is qualified on Linux/macOS; C ABI 1 remains synchronous and unchanged"
      ],
      "id": "analysis.revisions",
      "maturity": "experimental",
      "platforms": [
        "linux",
        "macos",
        "windows"
      ],
      "surfaces": [
        "rust-native",
        "c-presentation-v1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "Bounded host-ordered revision-bound completion candidates",
      "documentation": [
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/blob/0fef74edd5d4d6d536560036473980a41e1da3f3/docs/interaction.md#revision-bound-completion-candidates",
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/blob/0fef74edd5d4d6d536560036473980a41e1da3f3/docs/presentation.md#completion-surface",
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/blob/6ee2fe1e2006f940d0046676c73306bfc7da1070/docs/interaction.md#large-completion-navigation",
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/blob/eb246d3fd81353fc3be27c8924ee2321067530bf/docs/engineering/c-presentation.md"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/actions/runs/34485342480",
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/blob/0fef74edd5d4d6d536560036473980a41e1da3f3/docs/engineering/completion-contract.md",
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/actions/runs/34772036277",
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/actions/runs/34772036424",
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/blob/6ee2fe1e2006f940d0046676c73306bfc7da1070/docs/engineering/completion-keymap-suggestion.md",
        "https://github.com/mothx9/replai/blob/eb246d3fd81353fc3be27c8924ee2321067530bf/docs/engineering/c-presentation.md"
      ],
      "guarantees": [
        "Hosts own discovery, order, ranking, application context and scheduling; no callback or executor is acquired",
        "Per-candidate grapheme-aligned ranges, insertion, safe label and optional annotation are distinct; duplicates preserve host order",
        "Sets bind the originating Editor DraftRevision; stale delivery refuses before validation or activation with zero terminal bytes",
        "Whole-set validation is atomic; 4096 candidates, 65536 bytes per field and 4 MiB aggregate safe text are bounded",
        "Same-revision explicit deliveries replace in delivery order; host request preference is not inferred",
        "C ABI 1 retains its synchronous request/replacement contract unchanged",
        "CompletionAction adds PageNext, PagePrevious, First and Last; because the pre-release enum was exhaustive, downstream exhaustive matches must add arms"
      ],
      "id": "completion.candidates",
      "maturity": "experimental",
      "platforms": [
        "linux",
        "macos",
        "windows"
      ],
      "surfaces": [
        "rust-native",
        "c-presentation-v1"
      ]
